282
00:18:53.845 --> 00:18:56.380
It's just something that's
going around. Get back to work.

283
00:18:59.468 --> 00:19:01.936
Thank you. I'm glad someone here likes...

284
00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:05.389
(spitting) What the
fuck did you do to that?

285
00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.191
I cooked it... ?

286
00:19:07.259 --> 00:19:08.776
You absolutely did not.

287
00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:10.478
