Do exactly as I say.

293
00:19:39.791 --> 00:19:42.093
<i>(man moaning)</i>

294
00:19:43.395 --> 00:19:45.763
(panting)

295
00:19:52.571 --> 00:19:54.855
Now you see how it can be?

296
00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.692
When I'm made to feel comfortable.

297
00:19:57.776 --> 00:20:02.330
<i>you are made to feel le toucher de dieu.</i>

298
00:20:05.417 --> 00:20:07.952
<i>It's like our bodies
are all made up of these</i>

299
00:20:08.003 --> 00:20:10.321
secret little compartments. she says.

300
00:20:10.372 --> 00:20:13.007
what's got pleasures hidden inside 'em.

301
00:20:13.091 --> 00:20:15.760
And it just takes someone

302
00:20:15.827 --> 00:20:19.297
who knows how to unlock 'em. That's it.

303
