356
00:24:22.674 --> 00:24:25.576
I'm going to fuck my
way through high society.

357
00:24:25.627 --> 00:24:28.212
Nary a duchess's snatch be uncharted.

358
00:24:28.263 --> 00:24:30.347
<i>(men laugh)</i>

359
00:24:32.968 --> 00:24:34.969
What the fuck is this?

360
00:24:35.053 --> 00:24:36.604
You said tie it to the palm.

361
00:24:36.688 --> 00:24:38.772
That palm. That one.

362
00:24:38.857 --> 00:24:41.525
<i>You tied it to the wrong fucking tree.</i>

363
