Christ.

366
00:24:53.822 --> 00:24:56.490
Give a man a little bit of power.

367
00:24:56.575 --> 00:24:58.325
What the fuck difference does it make?

368
00:24:58.410 --> 00:25:00.110
They're both trees. ain't they?

369
00:25:00.161 --> 00:25:02.296
Agreed.

370
00:25:04.082 --> 00:25:06.050
Quick fuck?

371
00:25:11.222 --> 00:25:13.591
(creaking)

372
00:25:19.514 --> 00:25:21.932
<i>(wind rustling)</i>

373
00:25:27.739 --> 00:25:29.990
(exhales)

374
00:25:30.075 --> 00:25:32.026
(purring)

375
00:25:32.110 --> 00:25:34.778
<i>Morley: Shove over. Randall.</i>

376
00:25:36.281 --> 00:25:38.949
The shade's mine for the next hour.

377
00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:40.651
Don't want no arguments.

378
00:25:40.702 --> 00:25:42.703
Did you bring me barnacle?

379
00:25:42.787 --> 00:25:44.788
Oh. fuck.

380
00:25:44.839 --> 00:25:47.007
Sorry. mate.

381
00:25:47.092 --> 00:25:49.009
I forgot.

382
00:25:49.094 --> 00:25:52.012
You promised. For Betsy.

383
00:25:52.097 --> 00:25:54.798
You're right.

384
00:25:54.849 --> 00:25:57.217
Hold my spot.

385
00:26:01.806 --> 00:26:03.057
What the... ?

386
00:26:05.677 --> 00:26:07.945
Hey. what the fuck is your problem?

387
00:26:08.012 --> 00:26:09.613
Morley: No problem at all. sir.

388
00:26:09.681 --> 00:26:11.848
Just doing my share for a worthy cause.

389
00:26:11.900 --> 00:26:14.234
Oh. so what is it? You tell me a story

390
00:26:14.319 --> 00:26:16.370
