418
00:27:50.498 --> 00:27:52.583
Understood.

419
00:27:54.052 --> 00:27:56.253
- All that being said...
- Oh. Jesus Christ.

420
00:27:56.304 --> 00:27:58.338
I saw Billy speaking with Mr. Morley

421
