438
00:28:38.880 --> 00:28:41.098
Turn your pig. It's almost done.

439
00:28:50.859 --> 00:28:53.644
<i>- (wind blowing)
- (Lantern squeaking)</i>

440
00:28:57.348 --> 00:28:59.867
