482
00:31:21.158 --> 00:31:23.176
What the hell was that?

483
00:31:23.261 --> 00:31:25.762
Do you have some problem with
us holding onto that whore?

484
00:31:27.932 --> 00:31:31.351
You do realize she's the only thing
keeping what's left of our crew at our side.

485
00:31:33.438 --> 00:31:34.972
Fuck you.

486
00:31:41.529 --> 00:31:42.980
(sighs)

487
00:31:43.031 --> 00:31:45.032
You want the guns from my ship...

488
00:31:47.035 --> 00:31:48.785
